{"title":"2014 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_7\">Problem 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first three terms of a geometric progression are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/8/99867f5c473020300fc4d6c2da322e550a0bc2f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/f/9df2b093dad7aff038bf8e76013debc0f33465dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/6/f76bf02aeb1d529aef2a4953c053ddaef97334fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[6]3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />.  What is the fourth term?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/e/1ce555f7402c58e7f2bd569b30fd28c2495d9532.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }1\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\sqrt[7]3\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\sqrt[8]3\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }\\sqrt[9]3\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }\\sqrt[10]3\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"422\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The terms are  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/8/99867f5c473020300fc4d6c2da322e550a0bc2f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/f/9df2b093dad7aff038bf8e76013debc0f33465dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/6/f76bf02aeb1d529aef2a4953c053ddaef97334fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[6]3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />, which are equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/684558343af1fdf8588efdbd141b495f6ef01027.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{\\frac{3}{6}}$\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/0/cb0a85b22e4583b5f1f985ccb2b25ff4bb53e248.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{\\frac{2}{6}}$\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/e/20e8cd6c3e49307173c3305081a9ee699c36ac97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{\\frac{1}{6}}$\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\" />.  So the next term will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3d746089358315da3154c203094d6b9fa17e5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{\\frac{0}{6}}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/rJytKoJzNBY\">https://youtu.be/rJytKoJzNBY</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A\" title=\"2014 AMC 12A\">2014 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.p